"[[quarkus-tls-registry_quarkus-tls-pqc-enforcement-policy]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-tls-registry_quarkus-tls-pqc-enforcement-policy[`+++quarkus.tls.pqc-enforcement-policy+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.tls.pqc-enforcement-policy+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Sets the PQC enforcement policy.\n"
"\n"
"`STRICT`: a connection will be refused unless both the client and the server support a PQC-capable group (`X25519MLKEM768`, `SecP256r1MLKEM768`, `SecP384r1MLKEM1024`). The server requires PQC-capable clients.\n"
"\n"
"`CLIENT_NEGOTIATED`: the server advertises PQC groups but will not refuse a connection if the client does not support them, allowing fallback to classical key exchange.\n"
"\n"
"`RELAXED`: no PQC enforcement; standard TLS key exchange negotiation applies.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_TLS_PQC_ENFORCEMENT_POLICY+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-tls-registry_quarkus-tls-pqc-enforcement-policy]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-tls-registry_quarkus-tls-pqc-enforcement-policy[`+++quarkus.tls.pqc-enforcement-policy+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.tls.pqc-enforcement-policy+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sets the PQC enforcement policy."
msgstr ""

msgid "`STRICT`: a connection will be refused unless both the client and the server support a PQC-capable group (`X25519MLKEM768`, `SecP256r1MLKEM768`, `SecP384r1MLKEM1024`). The server requires PQC-capable clients."
msgstr ""

msgid "`CLIENT_NEGOTIATED`: the server advertises PQC groups but will not refuse a connection if the client does not support them, allowing fallback to classical key exchange."
msgstr ""

msgid "`RELAXED`: no PQC enforcement; standard TLS key exchange negotiation applies."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_TLS_PQC_ENFORCEMENT_POLICY+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "tooltip:strict[A connection is refused unless both the client and the server negotiate a PQC key exchange (`X25519MLKEM768`, `SecP256r1MLKEM768`, `SecP384r1MLKEM1024`). Clients that do not advertise PQC support are rejected during the TLS handshake.], tooltip:client-negotiated[The server advertises PQC key exchange groups but does not require the client to support them. If the client does not support PQC, the handshake falls back to classical key exchange.], tooltip:relaxed[No PQC enforcement; standard TLS key exchange negotiation applies. The server neither advertises nor requires PQC groups.]"
msgstr ""

msgid "tooltip:relaxed[No PQC enforcement; standard TLS key exchange negotiation applies. The server neither advertises nor requires PQC groups.]"
msgstr ""

