"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.tls.\"tls-bucket-name\".key-exchange-groups+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Sets the ordered list of enabled TLS key exchange groups (supported groups). If not set, the default groups defined by the `SSLEngineOptions` in use are used.\n"
"\n"
"Example values: `X25519MLKEM768`, `X25519`, `P-256`. When set, these groups take precedence over the engine defaults.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_TLS__TLS_BUCKET_NAME__KEY_EXCHANGE_GROUPS+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

